Bug 2076654 - Fix Wrap Long Lines in view source when wrapping starts on. r=mkmelin

The toggle read its state from a body class that Gecko no longer sets since
bug 1926922, so with wrapping on the first click did nothing. Derive the new
state from the pref instead, like Firefox does.

The menu check mark does not follow the command yet, so it can show the
opposite state. That is bug 2076486 (D329884); this patch does not depend on it.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329896


